  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e64acc72f5023e4db8651299a0ad706, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9713868951552
    m_Localized: Would you like to see a tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10142975610880
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10179898068992
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10202870272000
    m_Localized: Connect 3 ou more icons to attack ou to defend yourself based upon
      the type of blocks combined
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13446128422912
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10239121641472
    m_Localized: These are the types of blocks that you can use in the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15344680128512
    m_Localized: Basic Bullet - Causes Low Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15347372871680
    m_Localized: "Advanced Bullet - Causes \nMedium Damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15382915403776
    m_Localized: Epic Bullet - Causes Big Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15384253386752
    m_Localized: Health Kit - Heal 1 Hp Per Block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15385683644416
    m_Localized: "Dodging - Push Zombies So They\n Move Back"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10241168461824
    m_Localized: 'Upon defeating all zombies on a level you can choose a path to
      explore, each one with it''s own reward:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45336440950784
    m_Localized: OR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45326894714880
    m_Localized: Money Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45325145690112
    m_Localized: Health Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10242867154944
    m_Localized: This is your health bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47132332871680
    m_Localized: For each zombie that attacks you, you'll lose health based upon
      the type of zombie that attacks, if the hp reaches 0 you lose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10244834283520
    m_Localized: Let's talk about the zombies, while the game allow you to automatically
      aim at zombies, you can select a specific zombie you choose to attack using
      the icons above the combination screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76086561296384
    m_Localized: You just need to click the icon and the game will immidiately focus
      the selected zombie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13419444260864
    m_Localized: Congratulations you completed the tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77220155838464
    m_Localized: Now explore the mansion, but be careful with the dangers you'll
      find!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
